------------------------------------------------------------
PARITY (web source reproduced end-to-end)
------------------------------------------------------------
- Data sources (P1/S8 state-holder seam — no HTTP in the view):
    useAutomations      -> AutomationStatusSource.start/stop/refresh -> AutomationStatusUpdate
    useToggleAutomation -> AutomationStatusSource.toggle(id:enabled:) (optimistic flip in InMemory source)
    useTranslation      -> AutomationStatusStrings facade (NSLocalizedString table "AutomationStatusWidget")
- Composition: CompactView (cols<=1 || rows<=1) = icon + enabled/total + "Active" + failing dot-badge;
  FullView (2x2+) = summary stats row (Active / Failing / Auto-disabled) + scrollable automation rows.
  Per-row toggle shown only when isWide (cols>=3), exactly as web. Title/icon hidden when cols<=1.
- Per-row status badge precedence reproduced branch-for-branch (web getStatusBadge):
    auto_disabled -> "Auto-disabled" (danger); !enabled -> "Disabled" (neutral);
    consecutive_failures>0 -> "Failing" (warning); last_success_at -> "OK" (success); else "Idle" (neutral).
- Relative time reproduced (web formatRelativeTime): nil -> "—"; <1m -> "Just now";
  <60m -> "{m}m ago"; <24h -> "{h}h ago"; else "{d}d ago". Future next_fire_time deltas land in the
  "<1 min" branch -> "Just now", faithful to the web Math.floor(diff/60000)<1 guard (audited in tests).
- Summary reductions reproduced: enabled = a.enabled; failing = consecutive_failures>0 && enabled;
  autoDisabled = a.auto_disabled.
- States (every state renders — no hidden surfaces):
    loading (skeleton chrome), empty ("No automations configured" + icon), error (title+message+Retry),
    content, plus live/stale/offline freshness chip (ADR-013) over cached content.
- i18n: all 11 web-source strings mapped to widget.automationStatus.* keys (title, active, failing, ok,
  idle, disabled, autoDisabled, toggle, noAutomations, justNow, ago) + registry displayName/description
  + native chrome (live/stale/offline/refresh/retry/errorTitle/loading) + a11y (lastRun/nextRun).
  No English string literals in native code; every literal is a facade fallback only.
- Accessibility: VoiceOver labels on every interactive control (toggle = "Toggle {name}", refresh, retry),
  combined row label (name, status, last/next run with em-dash dropped), Dynamic-Type system fonts
  (Font.TS), reduce-motion honored (TSSkeleton shimmer is reduce-motion gated).
- Telemetry: P1/S11 `view.opened` emitted once with surface slug "AutomationStatusWidget"
  (idempotent start(); re-arms after stop()).
- Registry: id "automation-status", category "automations", default 2x4, min 1x2, max 4x40 (clamped).

